<title>LATVIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JUNE 16.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JUNE 16.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main reports on Latvian state radio news at noon. Reuters has not verifed these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- Workers from the Riga Porcelain plant have started a strike over wages.</p>
<p>- Latvian people will receive information on their social insurance status.</p>
<p>- President Guntis Ulmanis starts his summer vacation today.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
